  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Ministry of Finance and Developing Planning&apos;s (including the PRSP Secretariat&apos;s) M&amp;E Capacity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the capability of the MFDP (which houses the PRSP Secretariat), to plan, manage and implement policies and programs of the PRSP document to achieve intended results on the ground in Lesotho. As it has very weak capacity, it requires help in translating the PRSP into executable plans and projects. Specifically, assistance is needed in developing capacity to (i) equip staff to think through the process of setting goals consistent with the PRSP,  (ii)  design programs and projects that deliver on those goals through the annual budgetary system and medium term expenditure framework, (iii) pick indicators and other means of monitoring progress with implementation, and (iv) evaluate ultimate impact of the programs on poverty.  The proposed IDF will be used to build the MFDP.s (including the Secretariat) capacity to undertake these tasks.  used to build the MFDP#s (including the Secretariat) capacity to undertake these tasks.</narrative>
  </description>
